        "content": "## Abandoned Cart Recovery\n1. Shopify checkout webhook logs cart to Sheets (status pending), only if buyer accepted marketing.\n2. After delay 1: if still pending, AI writes reminder, sent via WhatsApp (Twilio) + Gmail.\n3. After delay 2: if still pending, AI writes final reminder with discount code.\n4. Shopify order webhook marks the cart recovered, which stops reminders.\nDelays + discount live in **Normalize Checkout + Config** (demo: 2 and 3 minutes).",
